WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.526
Teacher midterm practice, question 22.

2
00:00:04.146 --> 00:00:07.790
True or false: the one one one direction in the F C C

3
00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:11.242
unit cell is parallel to the one one one plane.

4
00:00:12.942 --> 00:00:15.851
In any cubic crystal, the direction with the same

5
00:00:15.851 --> 00:00:18.540
indices as a plane is that plane's normal.

6
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.547
So the one one one direction is perpendicular

7
00:00:21.547 --> 00:00:24.199
to the one one one plane, not parallel.

8
00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:27.695
So the answer is B: false.

9
00:00:28.514 --> 00:00:33.075
In cubic systems, matching indices mean perpendicular, not parallel.
